<title>GERMANY: POLL - German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecast.</title>
<headline>POLL - German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecast.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table lists the economic and market forecasts for the six months from July 23 issued by the ZEW Centre for European economic research institute. The averages are given in percentages (unless otherwise stated) and are compiled from a survey of 317 firms conducted from July 7-21.</p>
<p>					Current    Six-month forecast</p>
<p>INFLATION RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			   1.7	   1.8</p>
<p>    U.S.				2.3	   2.5</p>
<p>    Japan			     1.9	   2.1</p>
<p>    Britain			   2.9	   3.2</p>
<p>    France			    0.9	   1.0</p>
<p>    Italy			     1.4	   1.5</p>
<p>SHORT-TERM RATES (Three-month interbank rates)</p>
<p>    Germany			   3.1	   3.2</p>
<p>    U.S.				5.1	   5.5</p>
<p>    Japan			     0.7	   1.1</p>
<p>    Britain			   7.0	   7.5</p>
<p>    France			    3.4	   3.5</p>
<p>    Italy			     6.8	   6.8</p>
<p>LONG-TERM RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			   5.6	   5.8</p>
<p>    U.S.				6.2	   6.6</p>
<p>    Japan			     2.3	   2.7</p>
<p>    Britain			   7.0	   7.4</p>
<p>    France			    5.4	   5.7</p>
<p>    Italy			     6.5	   6.6</p>
<p>BOURSE (in points)</p>
<p>    German DAX		     4,100	 4,170</p>
<p>    U.S. Dow Jones		 7,920	 7,970</p>
<p>    Japan Nikkei		  20,100	21,600</p>
<p>    Britain FT-SE 100	    4,830	 4,830</p>
<p>    France CAC-40		  2,920	 3,000</p>
<p>    Italy MIBtel		  14,200	15,000</p>
<p>EXCHANGE RATES VS MARK (in marks)</p>
<p>    Swiss franc		     1.21	  1.21</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar		     1.78	  1.86</p>
<p>    Japanese yen		    1.55	  1.58</p>
<p>    British pound		   2.99	  3.00</p>
<p>    French franc		    2.96	  2.96</p>
<p>    Italian lira		    1.03	  1.03</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
